{"about_the_game":"<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3441410/extras/Hand_Intro.gif?t=1744309664\" /><br><br>Drawing hands and feet is one of the biggest challenges in art. With HAELE 3D \u2013 Hand Poses Pro, you'll always have the perfect hand reference at your fingertips. It includes a wide range of built-in poses and preset scenes, but if you need something specific, you can easily create your own custom hand poses\u2014whether it's one or two hands, with props or objects. Choose between male and female models, adjust materials, morphs, skin tones, and textures, and fine-tune the environment and lighting to craft the perfect reference for your needs.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3441410/extras/Posing.gif?t=1744309664\" /><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3441410/extras/Lights.gif?t=1744309664\" /><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3441410/extras/Environment.gif?t=1744309664\" /><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features: </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Female and male hands with morph targets<br></li><li> Various, highly realistic skin tone textures<br></li><li> Props (Weapons, Glasses, Food, and many more various items)<br></li><li> Editable preset poses<br></li><li> Editable lights and environments<br></li><li> Custom backgrounds<br></li><li> Adjustable camera angle, location, position and field of view<br></li><li> Save and load scenes</li></ul><br>HAELE 3D - Hand Poses Pro is an easy to use anatomy and gesture drawing reference tool designed for beginner to advanced artists. With a diverse range of editable options, it serves as a resource for learning how to draw human hands. Whether your art style is realistic, stylized, cartoon, anime or anything in between, this is easy to use app complements tutorials and aids 